{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790327040, "covers_from": "2026-09-25T09:04:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-25T09:05:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790327100, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-25T09:04:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "queue_number": 51568, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "交通很亂。不像新加坡重罰。台灣亂車子。毒駕愈來越多", "display_name": "大安代表 No.51,568", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T09:04:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35388, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我在忠孝東路四段附近的辦公大樓上班，大樓鼠患嚴重，周遭水溝也很臭。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.35,388", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T09:04:19+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44844, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "家裡附近的停車位收費金額能不能在一個統一的app上顯示出來，包含什麼時候可以停、什麼時候要收費等等的", "display_name": "中山代表 No.44,844", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T09:04:34+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36124, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "其他", "content": "公民住屋何時再蓋多一些，很多人買不起也租屋出現困難", "display_name": "士林代表 No.36,124", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T09:04:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50989, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "勞工在職場被霸凌後因為自知小蝦米也告不成大鯨魚財團，希望市府可以多站在勞工角度減少職場霸凌的問題", "display_name": "松山代表 No.50,989", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 35388, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.35,388", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 44844, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.44,844", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "fro